                  <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                    Solusi Hierarki Sumber Daya
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30">Bebas Deadlock</span>
