                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
                    Setiap filsuf wajib mengambil sumpit bernomor lebih kecil terlebih dahulu, sehingga siklus tunggu terputus.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </label>

              <!-- Mode 3: Pelayan (Arbitrator) -->
              <label class="mode-option flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 cursor-pointer transition hover:bg-slate-800/80">
                <input type="radio" name="algorithmMode" value="arbitrator" class="mt-1 accent-indigo-400 w-4 h-4 shrink-0" />
                <div>
                  <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                    Solusi Pelayan (Arbitrator)
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30">Bebas Deadlock</span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
                    Pelayan membatasi maksimal hanya 4 filsuf yang boleh mengambil sumpit bersamaan, menjamin minimal 1 filsuf bisa makan.
